# Terms of Ownership

## Purpose

Architectural terminology is exclusive.

Once a primary term has been adopted by a module or architectural layer,
that term becomes part of that module's vocabulary and shall not be reused
by unrelated modules.

This document defines those ownership boundaries.

---

## Match

Status
Reserved

Owner
Battle

Definition
One live Pokémon GO battle.

Notes
The Match is the primary runtime object of the Battle module.
Future tournament structures are composed of Matches.

Examples
BattleMatch
MatchTimeline
MatchWorkspace

---

