## Session

Status
Retired

Previous Owner
Multiple modules

Reason
Originally intended to describe an active interaction. Over time the term accumulated unrelated meanings across battle, registration, UI, and application state until it no longer conveyed architectural ownership.

The term is retired. Future modules shall adopt vocabulary specific to their own domain rather than reuse Session.

---

## Workspace

Status
Retired

Reason
Originally described several unrelated editable areas. The term became too generic to communicate ownership.

Replacement
Determined by the owning module.

